Third-party code in the LaFactory fork of SEOnaut
==================================================

The fork is distributed under the MIT licence of SEOnaut (LICENSE). The parts
below come from other projects, under their own licences, whose full texts are
in the licenses/ folder.

1. adobe/structured-data-validator
   https://github.com/adobe/structured-data-validator (commit 6918b52)
   Copyright 2025 Adobe. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
   (licenses/adobe-structured-data-validator.LICENSE.txt). The project ships
   no NOTICE file.
   Used in: internal/audit/schema_rules.go.
   Changes made by LaFactory (2026-11-24): the rich result rules of
   src/types/*.js and the subtree walk of src/validator.js are rewritten in Go
   on the item model of astappiev/microdata; the audit keeps the types a shop
   or a local business reports (Product, Offer, AggregateOffer,
   AggregateRating, Rating, Review, Brand, Person, BreadcrumbList, ListItem,
   Organization, OfferShippingDetails, MerchantReturnPolicy); the apparel and
   variant fields of merchant listings and the bestRating and worstRating
   recommendations are left out; rules for LocalBusiness, PostalAddress and
   FAQPage, the shippingDetails and hasMerchantReturnPolicy recommendations of
   offers and the url and logo recommendations of organizations are added from
   Google's structured data documentation.

