3. astappiev/microdata
   https://github.com/astappiev/microdata (v1.2.0, Go module dependency)
   Copyright (c) 2023 Oleh Astappiev, Copyright (c) 2015 Lars Wiegman.
   BSD 2-Clause License (licenses/astappiev-microdata.LICENSE.txt).
