4. Common Crawl web graph (data, no code)
   https://commoncrawl.org/web-graphs ; terms of use https://commoncrawl.org/terms-of-use
   The domain-level graph (vertices, edges, harmonic centrality ranks) is
   downloaded every quarter and turned into a local index by
   internal/webgraph. The file formats follow commoncrawl/cc-webgraph
   (https://github.com/commoncrawl/cc-webgraph, Apache License 2.0); no code
   of that project is copied.
